{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0152_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "7a0b3019a466ca240b14c65f62a6c4d246feda4e3a8fc1d2de3918bd72f76fcd", "ja": "そこはジュリアちゃんに協力してもらって、いろいろと\n教えてもらいました！　手取り足取り……ムフフ♪", "zh": "我请茱莉亚帮忙，教了我各种各样的东西！手把手地……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0152_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "10a5f177fbd8dce801fe4b6a9bdea2b4226c7858b855f065d98d1a809f6836f3", "ja": "これでありさも、立派な\n『ドラムが叩ける系アイドルちゃん』ですよね！", "zh": "这样一来，亚利沙也是名副其实的\n“会打鼓系偶像”了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0152_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7dd0fc8712cd4a5419d15cdf98d4e32dbbdf0126c08c4e18a1512d61aeed3c11", "ja": "そうだな……アイドルに、そんなジャンルが\nあるのかどうかはさておき……。", "zh": "是啊……先不说偶像里到底有没有这种类型……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0152_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "0d9b5e77fb0655e098912e7e7d6f9bb1c87cbd42559ac739a55eff9bf2145e80", "ja": "せっかくドラムを叩けるようになれたんですから、\nありさ、もっと練習しますよぉ～！", "zh": "好不容易学会了打鼓，亚利沙还要继续多练习哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0152_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "fa16171a772c994f4f3c1e09e5209eeebf3c7b8129db9e870c3c9e9144bbe733", "ja": "そしていつか、劇場のステージでジュリアちゃんと\n熱くてかっこいいセッションを……ムフ、ムフフ♪", "zh": "然后总有一天，要和茱莉亚一起在剧场的舞台上来一场热烈又帅气的合奏……嘿嘿、嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
